e":"邵当之豫章，发在近路，值秉疾病；时送者百数，邵辞宾客曰：“张仲节有疾〖12〗，苦不能来别，恨不见之。暂还与诀〖13〗，诸君少时相待。”其留心下士，惟善所在，皆此类也","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":72,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-c9f942188159de7cc6c2","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-88ac1b3a4b744cc5260f","layer":"original","quote":"初，钱唐丁谞出于役伍〖8〗，阳羡张秉生于庶民，乌程吾粲、云阳殷礼起乎微贱〖9〗。邵皆拔而友之，为立声誉","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
